WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.328
Riley: The park is crowded.

2
00:00:06.329 --> 00:00:10.905
Theo: Everyone is here to watch our soccer game.

3
00:00:10.906 --> 00:00:14.853
Ben: Speedy likes the warm sun.

4
00:00:14.854 --> 00:00:18.214
Sarah: I like your red uniforms.

5
00:00:18.215 --> 00:00:21.114
Theo: They are so bright.

6
00:00:21.115 --> 00:00:24.542
Everyone will be able to see us on the field.

7
00:00:24.543 --> 00:00:29.028
Skyler: I hope everyone sees me score a goal.

8
00:00:29.029 --> 00:00:32.833
I practiced for two hours last night! Riley:

9
00:00:32.834 --> 00:00:36.289
If I get the ball, I’ll pass it to you. Skyler:

10
00:00:36.290 --> 00:00:40.824
Then I’ll run as fast as I can and score! Chatter:

11
00:00:40.825 --> 00:00:42.875
Go, team! Riley:

12
00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:48.101
Let’s teach Chatter to say, "Go, Red Team." Chatter:

13
00:00:48.102 --> 00:00:50.981
Do your homework! Theo:

14
00:00:50.982 --> 00:00:56.431
Chatter, listen. Say, "Go, Red Team!" Chatter:

15
00:00:56.432 --> 00:00:59.519
Red! Skyler:

16
00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:01.422
That’s better! Riley:

17
00:01:01.423 --> 00:01:04.915
Chatter will make a great mascot. Theo:

18
00:01:04.916 --> 00:01:07.697
He’ll bring good luck to our team.

19
00:01:07.698 --> 00:01:12.075
Skyler: And help us score goals!

20
00:01:12.076 --> 00:01:15.753
Riley: There’s a special prize for the best sport.

21
00:01:15.754 --> 00:01:19.441
Theo: That’s someone who cheers for both sides.

22
00:01:19.442 --> 00:01:23.566
Riley: And doesn’t get upset if she loses.

23
00:01:23.567 --> 00:01:28.565
Skyler: I just want to win the game.

24
00:01:28.566 --> 00:01:31.966
Theo: Here comes Coach Ryan.

25
00:01:31.967 --> 00:01:35.592
We’re about to start!

26
00:01:35.593 --> 00:01:37.823
Mrs. Summers: Good luck, everyone!

27
00:01:37.824 --> 00:01:44.176
Kelli: Go, Theo, Riley, and Skyler!

28
00:01:44.177 --> 00:01:46.894
Skyler: Don’t forget to cheer for us, Chatter.

29
00:01:46.895 --> 00:01:48.985
We’re counting on you!

30
00:01:48.986 --> 00:01:54.482
Chatter: One, two, three, four, five, six!

31
00:01:54.483 --> 00:01:58.699
Riley: Here comes the other team.

32
00:01:58.700 --> 00:02:02.596
Skyler: Look, they’re wearing blue uniforms!

33
00:02:02.597 --> 00:02:05.615
Theo: Blue?

34
00:02:05.616 --> 00:02:08.570
Chatter: Blue, blue, blue!

35
00:02:08.571 --> 00:02:15.766
Theo: Uh-oh. Something tells me this isn’t going to be good!

